<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador Feb consumer price inflation by sector.</title>
<headline>Ecuador Feb consumer price inflation by sector.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ecuador's consumer price inflation by sector was as follows in February, the National Statistics and Census Institute said Monday:</p>
<p>    Food				     5.40 pct</p>
<p>    Clothing				 2.64 pct</p>
<p>    Housing				  1.96 pct</p>
<p>    Others				   1.72 pct</p>
<p>    Total				    3.47 pct</p>
<p>((-- Gustavo Oviedo, Quito Newsroom, 5932 258433))</p>
